@startuml
actor Client
participant "Google sign-in controller" as Controller
participant "Google sign-in handler" as Handler
participant "Google token verifier" as Verifier
database "SQL Server" as Database

Client -> Controller: POST /api/auth/google/sign-in with ID token
Controller -> Handler: SignInWithGoogleCommand
Handler -> Verifier: Verify signed claims
Verifier --> Handler: Google subject, nonce and verified email
Handler -> Database: Begin transaction and delete valid nonce
alt Active account linked to subject
    Handler -> Database: Save CRM refresh token
else Unlinked subject with verified email
    Handler -> Database: Save continuation token hash and next step
end
Handler -> Database: Commit
Handler --> Controller: Session or continuation
Controller --> Client: 200 OK with status
@enduml
